  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>THE BRAND<br><br>DRIPsox:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Dropping the sickest sportswear and streetwear Drip in the game. Our flagship Grip Socks have taken the football industry by storm and they're now being worn for all sports - gym goers, runners, rugby, hockey, bastketball, tennis, yoga and even streetwear.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Mission Statement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Boosting confidence, encouraging self expression and improving performance through stylish high-quality clothing.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Motto:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Look Good, Feel Good, Play Good</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Tagline:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Xpress Your Game</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>THE GRIP SOCKS PRODUCT &amp; USP's</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">For an in depth look into our grip socks product and other products on offer then head to www.dripsox.com&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">In short, our Grip Socks stand out for a few key reasons:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The Drip - They're the best looking grip socks on the market. Look good, feel good, play good.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">DripGrip Technology - Our grips have been designed to outdo the competition. Offering advanced footlock and traction, that leads to better comfort, peformance and injury/blister prevention.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Elite Quality - In a market with lots of cheap options that don't last. We designed a premium sports sock that outshines the competition.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">5 Sizes - We offer more sizes than other brands who just do a one size fits all. This means we cater for men, women and children of all ages and sizes. An accurate fit means better comfort and performance.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Multi-Use - Our socks are the ultimate sports sock, meaning they can be used to improve athlete performance in almost any sport. Plus, the stylish design also makes them stand out because they can elevate any sportswear and streetwear outfit.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TERMS</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The Cookie days are set at 30, meaning that you will get paid whenever a customer purchases within 30 days of clicking your link or inputting your code. Commissions are paid quickly and regularly. Payment will be made via Bank Transfer or Debit Card.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">You will get between 5-10% commission on total referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your referral code.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">💧10% for all Socks Products (e.g. Grip Socks &amp; Sock Sleeves)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">💧5% for all Other Drip (e.g. Hats, Hoodies, Sweatshirts etc)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">You also receive other perks such as:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">💧Increased commission for top performers</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">💧Free products for hitting milestones</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">💧Discount codes for your customers, to help you close more sales</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Join our team today and let's grow together!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">#XpressYourGame<strong></strong></span></p>",
